title: AICatalyst2026 napari taster
message: >-
  Image visualisation with Napari, a modular based framework
  with AI capabilities
type: software
authors:
  - name: 'Health and Bioscience IDEAS '
    email: HealthBioscienceIdeas@ucl.ac.uk
    website: 'https://healthbioscienceideas.github.io/'
abstract: >-
  Napari is an open‑source, Python‑based, modular viewer
  designed specifically for n‑dimensional scientific
  images. 

  For this session, while no python experience is necessary
  or assumed, we won't have time to go into any details or
  aspects of Python syntax or code. If you would like to get
  more information about Python or brush up on some of the
  basics beforehand, please consider reviewing background
  materials ahead of time, e.g. the online Software
  Carpentry python course:
  https://swcarpentry.github.io/python-novice-inflammation/ .
keywords:
  - napari
  - micro-sam
  - image analysis
  - AI
